# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Allow-list.
#
# This working directory also holds unrelated checkouts, research dumps, and
# scratch directories (see the end of this file). Instead of chasing them with
# an ignore rule each, everything at the top level is ignored and the project's
# own files are re-included below. Anything new that appears stays out of the
# repository by default.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/.agents/
!/.env.example
!/.github/
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/demo/
!/docs/
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/plugin/
!/psychologist/
!/sample/
!/scripts/
!/src/
!/tests/
!/tsconfig.json

# Dependencies and build output, ignored even inside the directories above.
node_modules/
dist/
plugin/lib/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Caches and local package stores.
.npm-cache/
.pnpm-store/
.cache/

# Generated profiles and pattern stores (may contain personal data).
profile-output/
.bot-patterns.json

# Secrets — never commit a real key. `.env.example` is the template and stays.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS and editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not part of this project (also covered by the allow-list above).
#
# - `orbit/` is a separate Tauri desktop application with its own repository
#   and history.
# - `AGENT-NOTE-orbit-*.md` document that application, not this one.
# - `bd-docs/`, `bd-docs-repo/`, `bd-research/`, `bd-source-repo/`,
#   `betterdiscord/`, and the `bd-*.md` research write-ups are third-party
#   BetterDiscord checkouts and notes used for unrelated research.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
